{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"087d679e636e08063ee24ae523a193d831c5eb83530e7e4d4788bba6748c3e31","digest":{"component_or_area":"Reconciler JQL builders (fetcher.py)","key_entities":["fetcher.py","jql_active","jql_done_recent","statusCategory","status = \"Done\"","tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_fetch_multi_project.py","tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_fetch_paging_split.py","Gerrit change 1815"],"problem_keywords":["reconciler","jql","status category","workflow","active set","done scope","custom status"],"propositions":["jql_active hardcodes status != \"Done\" instead of statusCategory != \"Done\", causing Closed/Resolved/Cancelled statuses to be incorrectly included in the active working set","jql_done_recent uses literal status = \"Done\" instead of statusCategory = \"Done\", missing non-standard Done-equivalent statuses in the recent-Done snapshot","the reconciler mis-scopes the active set for any workflow with custom closed-equivalent statuses outside the DIG/REB default","switch Done predicate from literal status comparison to statusCategory comparison to make queries workflow-agnostic","jql_active must exclude all Done statusCategory statuses and jql_done_recent must select Done statusCategory with ORDER BY updated DESC","per-project scoping and _validate_project_key must remain unchanged"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787594144633938001,"uuid":"23f5658a-298f-4223-b38d-892b29eee36f"}